%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black; mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">※ 적격자가 없을 경우 시상하지 않음<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode: char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode: char\"><b><span  style=\"font-size:11.0pt;; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">2. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">후보 자격<span ></span></span></b></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:9.75pt;line-height:115%; layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">1) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">교수학습<span >, </span>생활지도<span >, </span>인성교육\r\n등에 힘써 존경받는 교사상을 확립하신 분<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:9.75pt;line-height:115%; layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">2) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">교육 프로그램 개발 등 교육 연구활동에 힘쓰신 분<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:9.75pt;line-height:115%; layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">3) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">지역사회 봉사활동<span >, </span>선행 등으로 사회의 귀감이 되시는 분<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:10.0pt;mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; ;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">※ 타 기관\r\n또는 단체에서 시행하는 전국 규모의 교육상을 수상하신 분 제외<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:10.0pt;mso-char-indent-count: 1.0;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; ;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">※<span > 2020</span>년<span > 12</span>월<span > 31</span>일\r\n이전 퇴임 예정인 분 제외<span ></span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode: char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode: char\"><b><span  style=\"font-size:11.0pt;; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">3. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">후보 추천 자격 </span></b><b><span  style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">(2</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">가지 중 택\r\n<span >1)</span></span></b><b><span  style=\"font-size:11.0pt; ;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\"></span></b></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom:0cm;mso-para-margin-left:.92gd;mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">1) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;; color:black;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">기관장 추천<span > : </span>소속 기관장의\r\n추천<span ><br>\r\n</span></span><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">2) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;;color:black;mso-bidi-font-weight: bold\">일반 추천<span > : </span>동료 교원<span >, </span>학생<span >, </span>학부모<span >, </span>지역 인사 등<span > 3</span>인\r\n이상의 추천</span><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:11.05pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-ri