t:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">5. </span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">추천서 교부\r\n및 접수<span ></span></span></b></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:9.75pt;line-height:115%; layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">1) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">접수 기간 <span >: 2020</span>년<span > 5</span>월<span > 11</span>일<span >(</span>월<span >) ~ 7</span>월<span > 17</span>일<span >(</span>금<span >)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:9.75pt;line-height:115%; layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height: 115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">2) </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">접수 방법 </span><span  style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; color:black\">(2</span><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">가지 중 택 <span >1)</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:20.0pt;mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">온라인 접수\r\n<span >: </span>첨부된 공모 신청서 작성 후 이메일 제출 <span >(</span>발송처 <span >: <a href=\"mailto:dkculture@dkculture.org\">dkculture@dkculture.org</a>)\r\n</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:20.0pt;mso-char-indent-count: 2.0;line-height:115%;layout-grid-mode:char\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;color:black\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quo